WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:04.208
(swishing)
(playful music)

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:07.125
(machines beeping)

00:00:08.409 --> 00:00:09.901
- Hi sir, can I help you?

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:12.578
- Hi, I've been having some
really bad stomach pains,

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:13.564
and I was wondering if there's a doctor

00:00:13.564 --> 00:00:15.160
that can see me right now?
- Oh my god.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.451
I'm' so sorry to hear that, of course.

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:19.678
Just make a left, and
he'll see you right away.

00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:22.178
(dopey music)

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:27.567
(clearing throat)

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:29.549
(clearing throat)

00:00:29.549 --> 00:00:32.059
- Hi, I've been having
really bad stomach pains.

00:00:32.059 --> 00:00:33.129
I was wondering if there's a doctor

00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:35.157
that could see me right now.

00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:37.236
(forms slamming)
- Fill these forms out.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:41.881
We'll get to you when we can.
(dopey music)

00:00:41.881 --> 00:00:44.548
(intense music)

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.177
(sexy music)

00:00:52.484 --> 00:00:55.151
(woman moaning)

00:00:57.417 --> 00:00:59.903
- Don't worry, I've got you.

00:00:59.903 --> 00:01:02.562
(intense music)

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.062
(corny music)

00:01:10.132 --> 00:01:11.132
- Hello.

00:01:12.052 --> 00:01:13.493
(intense music)

00:01:13.493 --> 00:01:15.068
- Alright everyone, I've got a

00:01:15.068 --> 00:01:17.147
partial colectomy situation here,

00:01:17.147 --> 00:01:20.795
so let's get him prepped,
and start the incision.

00:01:20.795 --> 00:01:25.084
But, this shirt looks
kinda nice, and expensive.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:27.409
Let's get this off him
nicely and laundered,

00:01:27.409 --> 00:01:29.051
for when he gets outta here.

00:01:29.051 --> 00:01:32.384
(slow orchestral music)

00:01:33.565 --> 00:01:36.823
(cool jazz music)

00:01:36.823 --> 00:01:39.073
(swishing)

00:01:41.251 --> 00:01:43.584
(swooshing)

00:01:50.336 --> 00:01:51.797
- Just tell me, how bad is it?

00:01:51.797 --> 00:01:55.026
- I'm sorry to say, in
spite of your mild symptoms,

00:01:55.026 --> 00:01:56.092
(depressing violin playing)

00:01:56.092 --> 00:01:58.925
you only have a few hours to live.

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:02.329
(cool jazz music)
- Just tell me, how bad is it?

00:02:02.329 --> 00:02:05.384
- It's just a mild cold,
you'll be fine in a few days.

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:06.540
- Whew.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.059
(upbeat rock music)
- Hey you guys, okay.

00:02:09.059 --> 00:02:10.769
- Hey! (laughing)

00:02:10.769 --> 00:02:12.298
- Yay!

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:16.465
(neighbor snoring loudly)
(dopey music)

00:02:19.687 --> 00:02:23.465
(upbeat alternative music)
- Clean bill of health.

00:02:23.465 --> 00:02:24.298
- Great!

00:02:24.298 --> 00:02:26.018
It looks like your insurance
covered everything,

00:02:26.018 --> 00:02:27.862
so all we need from you is a $10 co-pay.

00:02:27.862 --> 00:02:28.695
(swooshing)

00:02:28.695 --> 00:02:31.098
(upbeat alternative music)
- Clean bill of health.

00:02:31.098 --> 00:02:32.519
(music stops abruptly)
- Congratulations.

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:35.827
That'll be $40,000.
(angry dramatic horns)

00:02:35.827 --> 00:02:39.291
- Do you validate parking?
- Of course not.

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:42.291
(upbeat rock music)

00:02:49.672 --> 00:02:52.079
(swishing)
(hinge squeaking)

